config EXAMPLES_XSHM
	bool "xshm: cross-domain shared memory demo (Jailhouse IVSHMEM)"
	default n
	---help---
		NuttX (Jailhouse non-root cell) exchanges a minimal mailbox with the
		root cell Linux through the Jailhouse IVSHMEM rw_section.

		Requires the cell config to declare the IVSHMEM regions
		(see crtos/jailhouse_overlay_pi4/configs/arm64/rpi4-nuttx.c).
